so being inside the VPC is not enough." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="965" width="610" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note_ln" value="Both instances LISTEN on one PostgreSQL channel.
